{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-04_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-04","title":"探查岩洞區域","storyCode":"14-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0deb63d789d686bec39f75b64d7d2784d9eb38cee07efaf2d9c3eee74fa1e116","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"倫蒂尼姆外圍地塊，荒廢的宅邸"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她回來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不滿的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真該死！能躲開那些魔族佬就已經夠不容易的了，怎麼她不僅沒死，還能找到我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是怎麼知道，我之前和那些魔族佬做過生意的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不滿的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，反正那些魔族佬現在也不管你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你是怎麼落到她手上的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不滿的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她用弩頂著我的腦袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不滿的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前就認識她，她那個時候可沒這麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒這麼，什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不滿的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，我沒有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"為公爵們幹了一輩子工作的私兵癱倒在地，一把弩支在他的額頭上，閃著寒光的箭尖抵著他的腦袋。\n來人的聲音冷漠如冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是——對、對不起，“銑痕”小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不該——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"弩箭洞穿了他的耳廓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人會給自己寵物的耳朵上打孔，來證明它的歸屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，人不是寵物。但……某些方面也都一樣，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，爬起來，給我一個結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓你們幹的事情怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的，“銑痕”小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們盡可能匯總了情報。監聽站的訊號很差，我們只能竭盡所能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只要結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從“灰禮帽”殘留的訊息，和偶爾能攔截到的通訊來看，確實有一支叫“典範軍”的隊伍成立了，領導人很可能就是您說的那位……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“維娜”小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們似乎正在前往……銀石崖前線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……銀石崖。他們居然還真的留在了戰場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續。有什麼新的資訊隨時通知我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，其實幹這些事，比我原本預想的要輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為，我會有更多負擔呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用顧忌什麼，也不用扮演什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到“維多利亞”了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"濃重的陰影中，一道赤紅的光芒閃爍了幾下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的職責，不就是守護她嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"行動開始後四十三小時"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道，你還是會來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……厄爾蘇拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去幾十個小時裡，那個喜歡玩炸彈的W來過一次，為我精心打造了這個監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲來過兩次，表達了一下對我的“關懷”。她還是老樣子，一旦注意力放在別人影子上，嗆人的時候反應就會慢一拍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在輪到你了？又想來說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你考慮好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題應該我問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的處境岌岌可危，唯一能指望的載具癱瘓在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我作為駕駛員，很可能掌握著什麼你們不知道的秘密，說不準什麼時候就會偷襲你們一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你真的應該殺了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望你能用你知道的情報來幫我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說夢話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就拒絕過你，你要是覺得我被你們俘虜就能改變立場，那你就太瞧不起我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……三條命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡茲戴爾的時候，你救過我們三次。我一次，伊內絲兩次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是你在日記本上記的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算個價吧，我想辦法還給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你就算不當雇傭兵回卡茲戴爾開家小店，也會賠到血本無歸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是希望，能活著回到卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲，盡可能多一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真宏大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，事到如今，疤痕商場的老規矩，就把它丟在卡茲戴爾地底吧。我們之間的帳，一筆勾銷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一次勸誡，赫德雷。現在不殺我的話，你一定會後悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄爾蘇拉，你有沒有想過，我們的目標從來都是一致的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了。你那些正確的理論我都聽膩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想用漂亮話買我的命，老朋友。這沒比錢強上多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵是沒有立場……但你和我，早就不只是雇傭兵了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲，打個賭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷會和厄爾蘇拉聊聊過去疤痕商場的情誼，厄爾蘇拉要求他盡快動手，然後過不了多久赫德雷就會一臉惆悵地回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要賭什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這個反應？我還以為放他們兩個單獨相處，你會狠狠吃醋來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再盯著我的影子反覆欣賞了，伊內絲，煩死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子和維多利亞人走了好久了吧……也不知道他們那邊怎麼樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這骨頭架子還在裝死，特雷西斯搞出來的浮誇天災又陰魂不散，也不知道曼弗雷德是不是下一秒就會蹦出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……本來炸死特雷西斯的機會都近在眼前了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，我知道你還在因為特蕾西婭的事躁動。可你最好確保你的炸彈腦袋冷靜下來，我們現在要準備的事還有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*薩卡茲粗口*！誰說我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，有些狀況……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了換班的時候，我們派出去偵察的人，有些沒回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“吊塔”那一隊，十個人去峽谷北邊了。現在聯繫不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是遇到能幹的術師了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們最後一次聯絡是在什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多三個小時前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果敵人能讓一整支傭兵隊伍悄無聲息地消失，他們這會應該已經打過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，現在最重要的任務還是守好脊椎，不要輕舉妄動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面有狀況，我們就這麼坐在這乾等？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意伊內絲的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們對外面戰場的情況一無所知，最穩妥的戰術是集中力量防守一處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒那麼多廢話，我的人平白無故地消失了，總要有個理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是迷路了就帶他們回來，要是遇見敵人就提前幹掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點！萬一是敵人分散我們戰鬥力的陷阱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭陷入被動……我主動出擊，就算是陷阱，也可以先用炸彈炸得他們現身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我半天時間，要是我沒回來，那就一定是遇到了難對付的傢伙，其他人不要再追過來，全力防守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是期間收到了阿米婭的通訊，也不用管我，你們立即啟動脊椎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不耽誤其他人工夫，我自己帶隊過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個，帶好傢伙，我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們來的就是這個地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按理說就是這個方向，我們往峽谷北邊深處走，只看到有這個山洞，不知道裡面是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是條密道？這裡會不會是什麼王庭軍藏寶貝的秘密據點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡要真的是王庭軍的秘密基地，我們掉下來的第一時間就會有兩百個血魔和食腐者圍過來唱咒術歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按之前可露希爾給的資訊，我們大概是在倫蒂尼姆西邊的荒山裡，離老傢伙們的正面戰場還遠得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是話說回來，總覺得有一股……（嗅聞）……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人待過的老舊到發霉的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭古老的東西，但赫德雷一定會喜歡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我猜猜看，我們的這些幸運兒是碰上了什麼敵人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，你什麼時候用炸彈了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說些什麼？我們一路過來什麼時候用炸彈了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牆壁上這些灼痕……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，能把石頭燒成這樣，但又沒有法術的痕跡？這是在做什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一驚一乍幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打鐵……我聽到了有人在打鐵——這裡有人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說些什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少在那嚇唬自己，這裡明明半個人影都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W……我們還要往裡面走嗎？我感覺有點不太對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話，我們出來是幹什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟著我的那些小弟小妹們身上用的都是上等貨，我還沒富裕到眼睜睜看著那些裝備爛在地下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有聽說過一個薩卡茲的傳說……在奎隆都還沒有出生的時候，薩卡茲曾經跟紅龍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上歷史課的有赫德雷一個就夠了，再多說一句，我就先把你扔到前面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有股血的味道……但不是薩卡茲的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不久前才留下的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戒備！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吼————————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
